# PICO-POE repository ignore rules.
#
# Tracked: source (firmware/, web/*.{html,css,js}, tools/), KiCad project
# files (schematics, PCB, BOM-source), CI workflows, top-level docs, and
# the per-dir .gitignore that keeps firmware/keys/ as a tracked directory
# without its secret contents.
#
# Heavy or generated artefacts (firmware build/, the WASM clang+lld bundle,
# the Pico SDK web bundle) are produced by GitHub Actions and not committed.
# See .github/workflows/build-llvm-box-arm.yml and build-web-sdk.yml.

# ---- OS junk ---------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db

# ---- Editor / IDE ---------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.history

# ---- KiCad: machine-local state, autosaves, derived exports --------------
*.kicad_prl
*.lck

*.000
*.bak
*.bck
*.tmp
*.kicad_pcb-bak
*.kicad_sch-bak
*-save.pro
*-save.kicad_pcb
_autosave-*
~*
#auto_saved_files#
fp-info-cache

*-backups/

*.net
*.dsn
*.ses
hardware/**/*.csv
hardware/**/*.xml
**/production/*
fabrication-toolkit-options.json

# ---- Firmware build outputs ----------------------------------------------
firmware/build/
*.uf2
*.elf
*.bin
*.hex
*.map
# The keys/ directory itself is tracked (so the layout is documented) but
# its contents are excluded by firmware/keys/.gitignore. Re-allow that
# per-dir gitignore so the directory survives in the worktree.
!firmware/keys/.gitignore

# ---- Python tooling (tools/pico-poe/ and any helper scripts) -------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ---- Web IDE: heavy / generated assets -----------------------------------
# The WASM clang+lld toolchain (~580 MB unpacked) is built by
# .github/workflows/build-llvm-box-arm.yml and downloaded from a Release.
# The pico-sdk web bundle (~10 MB) is built by build-web-sdk.yml.
# Local builds populate web/assets/ — never commit it.
web/assets/

# Emception's own build state lives inside the submodule. Belt-and-suspenders
# rule from this side too, since the submodule's gitignore is independent.
web/lib/emception/build/
web/lib/emception/upstream/

# Node deps for headless tests (web/tests/) — package{,-lock}.json are
# tracked so the h5wasm version pin is reproducible.
node_modules/

# ---- Logs / scratch -------------------------------------------------------
*.log

# Ad-hoc troubleshooting screenshots / browser-automation traces dropped at
# repo root or stashed by playwright-mcp. Real docs/diagrams live under
# hardware/ or docs/ and aren't matched by these rules.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.webp
.playwright-mcp/
*.h5

# ---- Defensive: never commit Claude Code per-project state ---------------
# Claude Code keeps its plans/memory/transcripts in ~/.claude/, not in the
# project tree, but this guards against accidents (e.g. a misconfigured
# hook writing into the repo).
.claude/
CLAUDE.local.md
# also not commiting Memory
CLAUDE.md
diag-logs/
